  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola has foci <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and it passes through <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The eccentricity of the hyperbola is",
